Touches only zuluCrypt-gui: createvolumeinexistingfile.cpp, password_dialog.cpp,
password_dialog.h, password.ui. Apply from the root of the zuluCrypt source tree:

    patch -p1 < 0001-zuluCrypt-gui-hidden-container-offset.patch

